  ["Sleep Health and Lifestyle Dataset · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗", "睡眠健康与生活方式数据集 · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗", "Datos de salud del sueño y estilo de vida · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗", "Sleep and lifestyle receipts · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗", "Sleep dataset loot · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗", "睡眠健康與生活方式資料集 · Laksika Tharmalingam · CC0 ↗"],
  ["Scenario ML uses real reference HR recentered to 62 bpm, respiration and SpO₂. Personal ML learns only from your own earlier data. Actual research replay preserves original values and missingness.", "情景模型使用重设为 62 bpm 的参考心率及呼吸、血氧。个人模型仅用较早的个人数据。重播保留原始值和缺失项。", "El modelo de escenarios usa pulso centrado en 62 bpm, respiración y SpO₂. El modelo personal usa tus datos anteriores. La reproducción conserva valores y ausencias.", "Sim uses baseline 62 bpm plus breathing and oxygen. Personal ML uses your earlier receipts. Original replay leaves values as recorded.", "Sim sets 62 bpm baseline with breathing and SpO₂ stats. Personal model uses older player logs; OG replay stays raw.", "情景模型使用重設為 62 bpm 的參考心率及呼吸、血氧。個人模型僅用較早的個人資料。重播保留原始值和缺失項。"],
  ["BIDMC dataset and license ↗", "BIDMC 数据集与许可 ↗", "Datos y licencia de BIDMC ↗", "BIDMC source receipts ↗", "BIDMC source and license ↗", "BIDMC 資料集與許可 ↗"],
  ["64 randomized isolation trees learn a reference distribution. Observations isolated in fewer splits receive a higher anomaly score. We translate pattern similarity into one limited component of the index.", "64 棵随机孤立树学习参考分布。较少切分即可隔离的样本异常分数较高。相似度只是指数的一部分。", "64 árboles aleatorios aprenden la referencia. Las observaciones aisladas con menos divisiones obtienen mayor anomalía. La similitud solo aporta una parte al índice.", "64 trees check familiarity. Easier to isolate means more unusual. That's one part of the score.", "64-tree build. Fewer splits means higher anomaly stat. Familiarity is one score component.", "64 棵隨機孤立樹學習參考分布。較少切分即可隔離的樣本異常分數較高。相似度只是指數的一部分。"],
  ["Why sleep and context?", "为什么考虑睡眠和背景？", "¿Por qué sueño y contexto?", "Why the sleep lore matters", "Why nap lore matters", "為什麼考慮睡眠和背景？"],
  ["NASA studies inadequate sleep, irregular schedules and workload as mission risks. Self-report adds information that physiological signals cannot establish alone.", "NASA 研究睡眠不足、不规律轮班和工作量等风险。自报提供生理信号无法直接说明的信息。", "NASA estudia el sueño insuficiente, los horarios irregulares y la carga de trabajo. El autoinforme añade información que los sensores no revelan.", "NASA studies short sleep, messy schedules and workload. Your own report adds lore the sensors don't have.", "NASA studies sleep loss, irregular shifts and workload. Player reports add stats sensors can’t infer.", "NASA 研究睡眠不足、不規律輪班和工作量等風險。自報提供生理信號無法直接說明的信息。"],
  ["NASA sleep research ↗", "NASA 睡眠研究 ↗", "Investigación de NASA sobre el sueño ↗", "NASA sleep receipts ↗", "NASA nap research ↗", "NASA 睡眠研究 ↗"],
  ["Responsible collection", "负责任的数据采集", "Recogida responsable", "Get the receipts responsibly", "Collect stats responsibly", "負責任的資料采集"],
  ["A validated cuff measures BP. Optical and electrodermal signals need quality checks; EDA alone cannot determine mental health or hydration.", "血压用经过验证的袖带测量。光学和皮肤电信号需检查质量。皮肤电不能单独判断心理健康或补水状态。", "Usa un manguito validado para la presión. Verifica la calidad de señales ópticas y de EDA. La EDA sola no determina salud mental ni hidratación.", "Validated cuff for BP; optics and EDA need quality checks. EDA can't read mental health or hydration alone.", "Validated cuff loot for BP. Optics and EDA need a quality gate. EDA alone can't reveal mood or hydration.", "血壓用經過驗證的袖帶測量。光學和皮膚電信號需檢查質量。皮膚電不能單獨判斷心理健康或補水狀態。"],
  ["NHLBI BP measurement guide ↗", "NHLBI 血压测量指南 ↗", "Guía de presión arterial del NHLBI ↗", "NHLBI cuff receipts ↗", "NHLBI BP guide ↗", "NHLBI 血壓測量指南 ↗"],
  ["What still needs evaluation?", "还有哪些方面需要评估？", "¿Qué falta por evaluar?", "Which receipts are still missing?", "What needs more testing?", "還有哪些方面需要評估？"],
  ["More participants, longer recordings, compatible sleep/activity datasets, subject-held-out testing, calibrated models and domain review. This is a concept prototype, not NASA affiliated or clinically validated. Check current submission rules, provide team credits and keep dataset attribution.", "还需要更多参与者、更长记录、可比较的睡眠与活动数据、按人留出的测试、校准与专家审查。这是概念原型，非 NASA 官方产品，未经临床验证。提交时请确认规则、团队署名与数据许可。", "Faltan más participantes, registros más largos, datos comparables de sueño y actividad, pruebas con personas excluidas, calibración y revisión experta. Prototipo sin afiliación de NASA ni validación clínica. Revisa las reglas, créditos y licencias.", "We need longer logs, more people, comparable data, held-out participant tests, calibration and expert review. Concept only, no NASA affiliation or clinical validation. Check rules, credits and data attribution.", "More players, longer logs, better datasets, held-out tests, calibration and expert review needed. Prototype only; no NASA affiliation or clinical validation. Check rules, credits and sources.", "還需要更多參與者、更長記錄、可比較的睡眠與活動資料、按人留出的測試、校準與專家審查。這是概念原型，非 NASA 官方產品，未經臨床驗證。提交時請確認規則、團隊署名與資料許可。"]
